6. Noticing the Missing Log File

The log files were numbered 1, 2, and 4 - suspiciously missing logs/3.txt. Since the hint said "deletion was interrupted before any git objects were touched", the missing file should still exist as a Git object.
7. Searching for the Missing File in Git Objects
bash

# Copy repository to local machine for easier analysis
sudo cp -r /mnt/part3_ext/home/ctf-player/Code/killer-chat-app /home/kali/Downloads/
sudo chown -R kali:kali /home/kali/Downloads/killer-chat-app
cd /home/kali/Downloads/killer-chat-app

# Search all blob objects for flag patterns
git cat-file --batch-check --batch-all-objects | while read hash type size; do
    if [ "$type" = "blob" ]; then
        content=$(git cat-file -p $hash 2>/dev/null | head -5)
        if echo "$content" | grep -q -i "flag\|pico\|ctf\|{"; then
            echo "=== $hash ==="
            echo "$content"
            echo ""
        fi
    fi
done

